{
  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives clear-state forward bias, obstacle-specific one-shot recovery, rare backward use only after front blockage, and quick return to forward exploration when path_clear is observed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model sensors as uncontrollable outcomes and motion primitives as controllable capabilities in separate plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification for clear exploration, one for front-obstacle recovery, one for left-obstacle recovery, one for right-obstacle recovery, and one alternation spec to bias coverage by preventing endless random_walk pulses"
  ],
